---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import founderPhoto from '../assets/about/founder.png';
import FacetField from './FacetField.astro';
---

<!-- overflow-hidden keeps the decorative facet inside this section: the small
     bottom-left accent mark is absolutely positioned and would otherwise bleed
     down into the Contact section below. -->
<section id="about" class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl overflow-hidden px-6 py-20">
	<!-- Single facet accent bleeding off the bottom-left, the one quadrant with
	     no content: it sits under the shorter photo column, clear of the story
	     text. Sized/positioned differently from Hero's two instances.
	     lg-only: below lg the grid stacks, so this corner is occupied by the
	     story copy and the mark would sit behind the text. -->
	<FacetField class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 hidden h-[340px] w-[340px] lg:block" opacity={0.1} />

	<div class="relative grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-16">
		<!-- Photo -->
		<div class="scroll-reveal scroll-reveal-delay-1 lg:col-span-2">
			<div class="relative">
				<div
					class="absolute -inset-3 rounded-3xl opacity-20 blur-2xl"
					style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-accent));"
				>
				</div>
				<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
					<Image
						src={founderPhoto}
						alt="Abdullahi Haruna Abdullahi, Founder of Karamba Technologies"
						class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover"
						widths={[400, 800]}
						sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 360px, 100vw"
					/>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Story -->
		<div class="scroll-reveal scroll-reveal-delay-2 lg:col-span-3">
			<span class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-primary);">About Us</span>
			<h2 class="mt-2 font-heading text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl" style="color: var(--color-text);">
				Our Story
			</h2>

			<p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
				Karamba began on a broiler farm in Kano. Running our own farm showed us how much of a
				business lives in notebooks, chat threads and spreadsheets, and how much time that costs.
				So we started building the tools we wished we had: simple software that does the
				repetitive work for you.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
				Our vision is to grow into a large enterprise, starting with the software solutions for
				Nigerian farms, schools, NGOs and SMEs need most, and building from there.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
				As a Muslim-owned company, honesty and amanah, the trust our faith calls us to
				honour, guide how we treat every client and every project.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl p-5" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
				<div>
					<h3 class="font-heading text-base font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-text);">
						Abdullahi Haruna Abdullahi
					</h3>
					<p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
						Founder &amp; Software Engineer
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-dashed p-5" style="border-color: var(--color-border);">
				<h3 class="font-heading text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-text);">
					Building Our Team
				</h3>
				<p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
					Karamba is growing. If you're a developer or designer who wants to build something
					real, we'd like to hear from you.
				</p>
				<a
					href="#contact"
					class="mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold transition-opacity hover:opacity-70"
					style="color: var(--color-primary);"
				>
					Get in touch →
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>